{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060114/block/singleImage/3247518/df/01M5S1YDT7AZGCHHYNR1G3CAEM.jpeg?updatedAt=1792916051\"/><figcaption>本港天氣晴朗。(鍾式明攝)</figcaption></figure><p>霜降已過，本港依舊炎熱。天文台表示，受乾燥的東北季候風影響，今(25日)明兩日廣東天色普遍晴朗。天文台預測，今日天晴乾燥，氣溫介乎24至31度，吹和緩北至東北風。展望明日大致天晴。隨後一兩日風勢較大，雲量逐漸增多。</p><p>隨著季候風補充逐漸影響華南沿岸，本周中期該區風勢較大，雲量逐漸增多。明日氣溫介乎26至31度，大致天晴。隨後數日氣溫維持在25至30度，日間部分時間有陽光。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T08:23:51.749955+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":200,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T02:23:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T05:18:05.253368+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T08:20:15.977296+00:00","content_hash":"c1bb529288e6f6f27515045afc83c26696542df8844e8958c464fc993977a4b7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-25T08:23:51.749955+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}